  "label": "Self-acceptance struggle",
  "description": "The concept of self-acceptance as a psychological and social challenge, particularly for marginalized identities. This is a universal human experience but is often more pronounced for individuals who face societal rejection or discrimination based on their identity, such as LGBTQ+ individuals. The meme uses the drag performer as a symbol of external acceptance and performance, contrasting with the internal struggle described in the text.",
